cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this pipeline, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "RNAseq_pre_processing: a Snakemake workflow for RNA-seq pre-processing, differential expression and splicing quantification"
abstract: >-
  A Snakemake workflow that takes raw RNA-seq reads (local FASTQs or SRA
  accessions) through trimming, alignment, transcript quantification and QC,
  and optionally through genome-browser track generation, differential gene
  expression with DESeq2, and differential splicing with StringTie and rMATS
  including novel-isoform and cryptic-exon annotation.
authors:
